Partition Key Strategy

Important for ordering guarantees.

Example key:

accountId

All messages for the same account go to the same partition.

Example:

Account 101 → Partition 2
Account 101 → Partition 2
Account 101 → Partition 2

Order preserved.

Good Partition Keys

Examples:

userId
orderId
accountId
transactionId
Bad Partition Keys
timestamp
random value

May cause data imbalance.

